---
layout: base.njk
title: Videos
description: Video teachings and updates from Richmond Petersburg Christadelphians.
permalink: /videos/
---

<section class="blog-hero">
    <div class="blog-hero__container">
        <h1 class="blog-hero__title">Videos</h1>
        <p class="blog-hero__subtitle">Watch teachings and updates from our community</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="videos-index">
    <div class="videos-index__container">
        {% if videos.all | length %}
        <div class="videos-grid">
            {% for video in videos.all %}
            {% include "video-card.njk" %}
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
        {% else %}
        <p class="videos-index__empty">No videos yet. Check back soon.</p>
        {% endif %}
    </div>
</section>
